  xcap-seam-tag worktree sees it via the symlink); once green and proven, port to
  codygunton/clean, push, re-pin flake.lock (no upstream PR).

  Shall I implement it? The design is verified sound and minimal, scoped to one
  file. If you want to eyeball anything in the shape first — particularly the
